# Runway

> Runway is an AI research and product company building foundational Real-World Intelligence: models that can understand, simulate and act in the world. We offer products and services built on top of this intelligence, spanning a complete creative suite, a developer platform and a robotics toolkit.

Notes for agents:

- The product runs in the browser at https://app.runwayml.com and accounts start free.
- Our models include Runway's own frontier models alongside third-party models (Kling, Veo, Seedance and more) in one workspace.
- This site (runway.com) is the marketing and content home: product pages, pricing, research, customer stories and guides.

## Products

- [Product overview](https://runway.com/product): The complete Creative Suite, with endless ways to generate and edit video, images and audio in one cloud workspace. Built for individuals and teams of all sizes.
- [Pricing](https://runway.com/pricing): Plans, credits and what each tier includes.
- [Enterprise](https://runway.com/enterprise): Security, controls and support for teams and enterprises.
- [Developer platform](https://runway.com/api): The AI media platform for developers. Build pipelines combining multiple models, modalities and tasks, and trigger Workflows via custom endpoints.
- [Runway MCP](https://runway.com/mcp): Connect Runway to agents like Claude and ChatGPT.
- [Runway MCP announcement](https://runway.com/news/company-news/mcp): What the MCP integration is and how to set it up.
- [Robotics](https://runway.com/product/robotics): A complete toolkit to run policy inference through photorealistic simulation, from evaluation to synthetic data generation, powered by GWM-1, our General World Model.
- [AI video generator](https://runway.com/product/ai-video-generator): Generate video from text, an image or a clip.
- [AI video editor](https://runway.com/product/ai-video-editor): Edit real footage with generative models.
- [Use cases](https://runway.com/use-cases): What teams make with Runway, by scenario.
- [Solutions](https://runway.com/solutions): Runway by industry and workflow.

